Package: lcNRB
Title: Reproducible Access to Nepalese Macroeconomic Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("LC", "Package Authors", , "lcNRB@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides reproducible, automated access to macroeconomic data
    published by Nepal Rastra Bank. The package discovers official source
    workbooks, preserves source vintages in a local cache, parses verified
    workbook layouts, validates standardized long-form observations, and
    retains source provenance. This independent package is not affiliated
    with or endorsed by Nepal Rastra Bank.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
